<title>USA: Miami finance director Surana resigns.</title>
<headline>Miami finance director Surana resigns.</headline>
<dateline>MIAMI 1996-09-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Miami deputy finance director Dipak Parekh was appointed acting director on Tuesday following the resignation of finance director Manohar Surana, city officials said.</p>
<p>Surana, who was also assistant city manager, announced his resignation on Friday in a memo to City Manager Cesar Odio. Surana, 52, was unavailable for comment on Tuesday, but said in the memo he was retiring.</p>
<p>--Jane Sutton, 305-374-5013</p>
</text>
